{{Term/Store|Shock Resistance||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
Shock Resistance is an [[Added Effect]] that reduces the damage [[Link]] takes from [[Electricity]] by 33%, 66%, and 100% for levels one, two, and three respectively. The level three Effect also prevents Link from dropping held [[Equipment]]. This Effect does not affect the explosion damage from [[Lightning]] strikes, and it has a maximum potency of level three.

In {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, the following [[Material]]s and [[Armor]] pieces grant Shock Resistance:

